Florida Department of Health letterhead. That's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:20.820
sort of weird for an analysis supposedly from&nbsp;
the Florida Department of Health. There is no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:26.700
author is listed on the study. Well, that's really&nbsp;
weird. And of course, it's not peer reviewed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:31.980
obviously. I mean, there's not even a claim&nbsp;
