00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:52.440
How should we look at vaccine safety? You would&nbsp;
want to take a group of vaccinated people and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:58.140
a group of not vaccinated people. Maybe they&nbsp;
get a placebo, the non-vaccinated people. So&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.140 --> 00:04:02.580
no one even knows whether they are or aren't&nbsp;
vaccinated. You match them up demographically&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:09.240
so that in both of these groups you have similar&nbsp;
underlying health statuses, other parameters, age,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:14.940
