00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:14.460
at the first four weeks and then they call weeks,&nbsp;
5 to 25, the control group. That doesn't make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:19.200
sense. That's not good science. And I'm getting&nbsp;
so wound up that I punched my microphone. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:27.600
what they also did was they excluded people&nbsp;
from the study who had COVID, died of COVID,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:33.300
and they excluded people with boosters. Why&nbsp;
would you do that? Wait a second. You want to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:39.600
study something related to COVID and the vaccine?&nbsp;
You have no control group and you exclude people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:44.940
from the study who had COVID, died of COVID or&nbsp;
had a booster, meaning they went beyond their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:51.000
first two dose regimen. Well, that's nonsense.&nbsp;
That doesn't make sense. They also don't actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:56.460
have any medical information for cause of death.&nbsp;
They only have death certificates. And as we know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.460 --> 00:06:05.280
death certificates through no deliberate attempt&nbsp;
at fraud, don't always represent. The heart of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

