the birth certificate, but not the fact that you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:21.000
had COVID and the reason you were in the hospital&nbsp;
was COVID. And then a complication came up. Just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:28.860
as one example. They don't know how many people&nbsp;
died of undocumented COVID cases after one dose&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:35.160
of the vaccine, for example, where one dose of the&nbsp;
